 "subs": [
  {
   "a": 0.3,
   "b": 1.892,
   "zh": "一年前用 Claude Code",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 1.942,
   "b": 3.678,
   "zh": "是你说一句、它做一步",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 3.728,
   "b": 4.392,
   "zh": "现在呢？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 4.792,
   "b": 6.824,
   "zh": "Anthropic 官方放出一段对谈：",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 6.874,
   "b": 9.194,
   "zh": "Claude Code 团队的三位工程师",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 9.244,
   "b": 11.564,
   "zh": "聊自己现在怎么用 Claude Code",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 11.614,
   "b": 13.18,
   "zh": "一年里，有三个转变",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 13.53,
   "b": 15.308,
   "zh": "第一，不盯过程，只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 15.358,
   "b": 16.618,
   "zh": "Sid 七八成的工作",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 16.668,
   "b": 19.177,
   "zh": "都在 Slack 里的 Claude Tag 上完成",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 20.527,
   "b": 24.727,
   "zh": "以前特别在意对话记录，在意每一次工具调用、",
   "en": "caring about the transcript so much and like caring about each individual tool call",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 24.727,
   "b": 27.227,
   "zh": "模型做的每一个决定；",
   "en": "and each individual decision that the model makes",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 27.227,
   "b": 32.527,
   "zh": "现在退远一步：我有一个目标，我想把它达成。",
   "en": "to just zoomed out view of like, I have a goal and I'd like to achieve this goal.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 33.227,
   "b": 36.827,
   "zh": "然后把这个目标交给模型，让它替你完成。",
   "en": "And you just kind of give that goal to the model to achieve for you.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 37.227,
   "b": 39.028,
   "zh": "第二，功能是临时的",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 39.428,
   "b": 42.728,
   "zh": "那时的模型，做不了任何长线任务。",
   "en": "The models were not able to do any kind of long horizon work.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 43.228,
   "b": 47.228,
   "zh": "给它五件事，做完三件就放弃了。",
   "en": "You'd give it like five things to do and it would do three things and just give up.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 47.828,
   "b": 51.228,
   "zh": "我们就想：要不给它一张待办清单？效果很好。",
   "en": "So we were like, oh, maybe you give it a to-do list and it'll do really well.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 51.228,
   "b": 55.428,
   "zh": "可一年后，它就消失了，待办清单已经用不上了。",
   "en": "But a year from then, it's disappeared. You don't really need the to-do list anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 55.428,
   "b": 60.528,
   "zh": "你得对自己做的东西毫不留恋，",
   "en": "…you got to be very unattached to the things you're building",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 60.528,
   "b": 63.328,
   "zh": "因为它们很快就会消失。",
   "en": "because they're going to go away fairly quickly.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 63.628,
   "b": 66.065,
   "zh": "底层模型，每两个月就换一次",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 66.115,
   "b": 67.519,
   "zh": "Thariq 的说法是—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 67.569,
   "b": 67.71,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 68.11,
   "b": 73.61,
   "zh": "某种程度上，我们就是软件开发未来的「精神时光屋」。",
   "en": "So I think in some ways, we're this hyperbolic time chamber of where software development is going.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 73.91,
   "b": 75.174,
   "zh": "第三，人只看大局",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 75.224,
   "b": 76.817,
   "zh": "以前审代码是这样的—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 76.867,
   "b": 76.981,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 77.381,
   "b": 81.081,
   "zh": "审代码的人会挑出三个小毛病发上去，",
   "en": "and they would pick out three little nitpicks to post.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 81.381,
   "b": 85.081,
   "zh": "其实就是在告诉你：这段代码我看过了。",
   "en": "It was kind of just like, I'm signaling to you that I read this code.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 85.081,
   "b": 90.481,
   "zh": "现在，这些小问题可以交给 Claude 自己找、自己改。",
   "en": "Now, you can have Claude figure out those little things and address them autonomously.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 90.881,
   "b": 93.781,
   "zh": "这已经不是人审代码的重点了。",
   "en": "That's not really the important part of human code review anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 94.081,
   "b": 96.297,
   "zh": "人只盯 Claude 没想明白的：",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 96.347,
   "b": 98.456,
   "zh": "接口怎么设计，边界划在哪",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 98.506,
   "b": 101.154,
   "zh": "连它每一步在想什么，都不用看了",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 101.604,
   "b": 104.904,
   "zh": "这层抽象，一开始有点吓人。",
   "en": "And that abstraction was like a little scary to get through at first.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 105.004,
   "b": 108.104,
   "zh": "我看不到 Claude 当下在想的每一件事。",
   "en": "I can't see everything that Claude is thinking as it's thinking it.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 108.104,
   "b": 111.904,
   "zh": "就像被逼着放手，让它自己发挥。",
   "en": "And like being forced even to let Claude cook.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 112.204,
   "b": 115.174,
   "zh": "模型每两个月换一次，你搭的流程迟早要拆",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 115.224,
   "b": 117.716,
   "zh": "能留下来的，只有你给它的那个目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  }
 ],
